*% Part of Minkar.
*%
*% A printer that takes PDF as it is (its IEEE 1284 device ID lists PDF):
*% the PDF goes to it unchanged (pdfcopy).
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "1.0"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName: "GENPDF.PPD"
*Manufacturer: "Generic"
*Product: "(Generic PDF Printer)"
*ModelName: "Generic PDF Printer"
*ShortNickName: "Generic PDF Printer"
*NickName: "Generic PDF Printer"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 0"
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*ColorDevice: True
*DefaultColorSpace: RGB
*FileSystem: False
*Throughput: "1"
*LandscapeOrientation: Plus90
*TTRasterizer: Type42
*cupsVersion: 2.4
*cupsFilter2: "application/vnd.cups-pdf application/pdf 0 -"
*OpenUI *PageSize/Media Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: Letter
*PageSize Letter/US Letter: "<</PageSize[612 792]>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Legal/US Legal: "<</PageSize[612 1008]>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Executive/Executive: "<</PageSize[522 756]>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize A4/A4: "<</PageSize[595 842]>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize A5/A5: "<</PageSize[420 595]>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize B5/B5: "<</PageSize[516 729]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize
*OpenUI *PageRegion: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageRegion
*DefaultPageRegion: Letter
*PageRegion Letter/US Letter: "<</PageSize[612 792]>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Legal/US Legal: "<</PageSize[612 1008]>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Executive/Executive: "<</PageSize[522 756]>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion A4/A4: "<</PageSize[595 842]>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion A5/A5: "<</PageSize[420 595]>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion B5/B5: "<</PageSize[516 729]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageRegion
*DefaultImageableArea: Letter
*ImageableArea Letter/US Letter: "18 18 594 774"
*ImageableArea Legal/US Legal: "18 18 594 990"
*ImageableArea Executive/Executive: "18 18 504 738"
*ImageableArea A4/A4: "18 18 577 824"
*ImageableArea A5/A5: "18 18 402 577"
*ImageableArea B5/B5: "18 18 498 711"
*DefaultPaperDimension: Letter
*PaperDimension Letter/US Letter: "612 792"
*PaperDimension Legal/US Legal: "612 1008"
*PaperDimension Executive/Executive: "522 756"
*PaperDimension A4/A4: "595 842"
*PaperDimension A5/A5: "420 595"
*PaperDimension B5/B5: "516 729"
*DefaultResolution: 600dpi
*DefaultFont: Courier
*Font Courier: Standard "(002.004S)" Standard ROM
